            "chunk_type": "text",
            "content": "CONTENTS (CONTINUED)\n\nParagraph Page\n4.10 Longitudinal Control, § 25.145....4-26\n4.11 Directional and Lateral Control, § 25.147....4-26\n4.12 Trim, § 25.161....4-27\n4.13 Stability—General, § 25.171....4-27\n4.14 Demonstration of Static Longitudinal Stability, § 25.175....4-27\n4.15 Static Lateral–Directional Stability, § 25.177....4-28\n4.16 Dynamic Stability, § 25.181....4-29\n4.17 Stall Demonstration, § 25.201/Stall Characteristics, § 25.203....4-29\n4.18 Stall Warning, § 25.207....4-31\n4.19 Wind Velocities, § 25.237. To show compliance with this requirement:....4-32\n4.20 Vibration and Buffeting, § 25.251....4-33\n4.21 Natural Icing Conditions, § 25.1419(b)....4-33\n4.22 Failure Conditions, § 25.1309....4-37\nAppendix A. Airframe Ice Accretions....A-1\nAppendix B. Simulated Ice Accretions....B-1\nAppendix C. Design Features....C-1\nAppendix D. Examples of Airplane Flight Manual Limitations and Operating Procedures for Operations in Supercooled Large Drop Icing Conditions....D-1\nAppendix E. Related Regulations and Advisory Circulars....E-1\nAppendix F. Acronyms....F-1\n\nCONTENTS (CONTINUED)",
